Package: claude-status
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gnome-shell (>= 45), gir1.2-soup-3.0
Recommends: fonts-vazirmatn
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: mohammad mohammad soltani <azizsalehi50@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mohammad-mohammad-soltani/ClaudeAddonTools
Description: Top-bar badge for Claude Code on GNOME
 Claude Status shows when Claude Code is thinking, needs your approval
 or is done, right in the GNOME top bar. Approve permission requests from
 a card that drops out of the badge, see every session at a glance,
 translate questions to Persian, and pause all sessions automatically
 when your IP is in a region Claude doesn't support.
 .
 After installing, open "Claude Status" from your apps (it also opens on
 your next login) to connect it to your Claude Code account.
